  "question": {
    "text": "The plane <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> is rotated about its line of intersection with the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>xy</mi><mo>-</mo></math>plane by an acute angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math> . If the new position of the plane contains the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
